      },
      "notes": "Hex values from onedark.vim (colours measured inside Atom; Atom One Dark syntax theme). \"mono-2\" = hsl(220,9%,55%) and \"accent\" = hsl(220,100%,66%) from atom/one-dark-syntax colors.less, converted deterministically HSL->hex (not text-verifiable). No bg darker than background published, so bgDeep=bg. No pink."
    },
    {
      "id": "one-light",
      "name": "One Light",
      "family": "One",
      "scheme": "light",
      "sources": [
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/atom/one-light-syntax/master/styles/colors.less",
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/atom/one-light-ui/master/styles/ui-variables-custom.less"
      ],
      "official": {
        "syntax-bg": "#fafafa",
        "mono-1": "#383a42",
        "mono-2": "#696c77",
        "mono-3": "#a0a1a7",
        "hue-1": "#0184bc",
        "hue-2": "#4078f2",
        "hue-3": "#a626a4",
        "hue-4": "#50a14f",
        "hue-5": "#e45649",
        "hue-5-2": "#ca1243",
        "hue-6": "#986801",
        "hue-6-2": "#c18401",
        "syntax-accent": "#526fff",
        "level-1-color": "#ffffff",
        "level-3-color": "#eaeaeb"
      },
      "slots": {
        "bg": "syntax-bg",
        "bgDeep": "level-3-color",
        "bgRaised": "level-1-color",
        "bgHigh": "level-3-color",
        "fg": "mono-1",
        "fgMuted": "mono-2",
        "fgFaint": "mono-3",
        "red": "hue-5",
        "orange": "hue-6",
        "yellow": "hue-6-2",
        "green": "hue-4",
        "cyan": "hue-1",
        "blue": "hue-2",
        "purple": "hue-3",
        "pink": null,
        "accent": "syntax-accent"
      },
      "notes": "Atom publishes HSL only; every value converted deterministically to hex. HSL source: syntax-bg=hsl(230,1%,98%), mono-1..3=hsl(230,8%,24%)/hsl(230,6%,44%)/hsl(230,4%,64%), hue-1 cyan hsl(198,99%,37%), hue-2 blue hsl(221,87%,60%), hue-3 purple hsl(301,63%,40%), hue-4 green hsl(119,34%,47%), hue-5 red hsl(5,74%,59%), hue-5-2 red2 hsl(344,84%,43%), hue-6 hsl(41,99%,30%) and hue-6-2 hsl(41,99%,38%) (both labelled orange upstream; hue 41 amber, so hue-6=orange, hue-6-2=yellow), syntax-accent=hsl(230,100%,66%). level-1-color/level-3-color = one-light-ui lighten(base,4%)/darken(base,6%) of ui-bg hsl(230,1%,98%) evaluated as hsl(230,1%,100%)/hsl(230,1%,92%). No pink."
    },
